# Grounded Painterly Bakery and Strong Look-Around

Status: DONE
Milestone: M24 Coherent interior depth and natural-light composition
Dependencies: 20_SHOP_AWNING_AND_WINDOW_INTERIOR.todo; 21_WARM_BAKERY_INTERIOR.todo

## Purpose

The owner rejects the floating cake display and weak mouse response, and requests
a much richer hand-painted animated-film direction with coherent perspective,
support and natural light. Aim for original painterly warmth, not copied film
assets or an unsupported claim of absolute aesthetic/physical perfection.

## Tasks

- [x] Preserve the previous room artwork, runtime, tests and public showcase.
- [x] Identify independent counter compression/lift as the floating-scene mechanism.
- [x] Build one original3Droom with cabinet footings touching its actual floor.
- [x] Add original painted material textures, left-window light and contact shadows.
- [x] Use a strong bounded perspective camera while keeping the storefront fixed.
- [x] Render static wide/portrait/short fallbacks from the same room geometry.
- [x] Remove retired independently translated SVG layers and their upward lift.
- [x] Preserve transparent doors, click/skip/audio/accessibility and resource fallbacks.
- [x] Correct the now-tightly-coupled entrance focus handoff race without stealing focus.
- [x] Check ground contacts, projection, light consistency, visible displacement and responsive behavior.
- [x] Refresh entrance README image and publish only generated public files.

## Acceptance criteria

- Solid counter cabinet/footings meet floor atY0; no arbitrary display-only upward offset.
- One camera projects all surfaces/shadows coherently; movement reveals true depth.
- Strong mouse look-around without moving the outer frame or enabling touch parallax.
- Original decorative scene only, not real premises/menu/products or copied movie imagery.
- Static fallback remains complete and independent of WebGL availability.
- No extra image-tool views or claim of owner visual acceptance.

